## ✅ Sample Audit Chain

```bash
# Full audit (daily routine or manual)
python3 abilities/sentinel/sentinel_routine_audit.py

# Signature verification
python3 abilities/sentinel/verify_signature.py memory/hermes/hermes_session_journal_20250730.json

# Sentence-level contextual audit
python3 abilities/sentinel/sentinel_contextual_validator.py \
--thread memory/threads/idea_generator/session/idea_generator_session_20250730.json \
--journal memory/hermes/idea_generator_journal/session/hermes_session_journal_20250730.json

🧼 Journal Writing After Audit
Sentinel auto-writes its journal via:
python3 abilities/sentinel/sentinel_write_session_journal.py \
  --flow_context '{"flow_type": "audit", "temp": 0.3, "model": "sentinel.fp16.1b", "context_length": 4096}'

The journal is written to:
memory/sentinel/sentinel_audit_journal/session/
and signed with Sentinel’s Minisign key.




